        <body>
            <div xml:id="d135-a1-a5">

                <pb facs="0462" n="404" xml:id="pg404"/>


                <head>Department of State, Branch of the War and Marine–Section first.</head>
                <p>The citizen President of the republic has had the pleasure of receiving your
                    despatch of the 17th of August last, enclosing that of the 14th, from General
                    Angel Martinez, reporting his operations from the 23d up to date, when he
                    dispersed the traitor forces under Arvallo, and occupied Hermosillo on the 13th
                    of August, surprising the garrison.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">Independence and liberty!
                            <placeName>Chihuahua</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1866-09-26">September 26, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>MEJIA.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>General <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ignacio Pesqutera</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Governor and Military Commander of the State of
                            Sonora, Hermosillo</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
